{%- comment -%}
  A stone's small round picture before its name in the menus (2026-10-21, owner, as moonmagic.com's „By
  Gemstones“: a 30px round stone cut-out, 8px before the name). The pictures are the stone tiles' own files from the
  homepage „Всеки камък има значение“ section (templates/index.json „stones“), found in Shopify Files by name.
  Loaded at 60, 90 or 120px for the screen (2026-10-21, owner: blurry on phones when only a 30px file was
  offered).

  With part: 'meaning' it prints the stone's meaning instead (2026-10-21, owner, as moonmagic's „MOONSTONE /
  Intuition“): the same words as the homepage section's tiles (templates/index.json „stones“) — change both together.

  Prints nothing at all for a link that is not one of these stone collections, or when the file is missing.

  Accepts:
  - link: {Object} a menu link
  - class: {String} the image's class
  - part: {String} 'meaning' for the meaning; the picture otherwise (optional)

  Usage:
  {% render 'cj-menu-stone', link: childlink, class: 'cj-menu-stone' %}
  {% render 'cj-menu-stone', link: childlink, part: 'meaning' %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign cj_stone_file = ''
  assign cj_stone_meaning = ''
  if link.type == 'collection_link' and link.object
    case link.object.handle
      when 'диаманти'
        assign cj_stone_file = 'ChatGPT_Image_Sep_29_2026_07_44_01_PM.png'
        assign cj_stone_meaning = 'Вечна любов'
      when 'сапфири'
        assign cj_stone_file = 'ChatGPT_Image_Sep_29_2026_07_44_09_PM.png'
        assign cj_stone_meaning = 'Мъдрост и вярност'
      when 'рубини'
        assign cj_stone_file = 'ChatGPT_Image_Sep_29_2026_07_44_14_PM.png'
        assign cj_stone_meaning = 'Страст и любов'
      when 'изумруди'
        assign cj_stone_file = 'ChatGPT_Image_Sep_29_2026_07_44_18_PM.png'
        assign cj_stone_meaning = 'Надежда'
      when 'перли'
        assign cj_stone_file = 'ChatGPT_Image_Sep_29_2026_07_44_05_PM.png'
        assign cj_stone_meaning = 'Чистота и нежност'
      when 'циркони'
        assign cj_stone_file = 'ChatGPT_Image_Sep_29_2026_07_43_02_PM.png'
        assign cj_stone_meaning = 'Яснота и блясък'
    endcase
  endif
  if part == 'meaning'
    if cj_stone_meaning != ''
      echo '<span class="cj-menu-meaning">' | append: cj_stone_meaning | append: '</span>'
    endif
  elsif cj_stone_file != ''
    assign cj_stone = images[cj_stone_file]
    if cj_stone != blank
      echo cj_stone | image_url: width: 120 | image_tag: class: class, width: 30, height: 30, widths: '60, 90, 120', sizes: '30px', loading: 'lazy', alt: ''
    endif
  endif
-%}
